" /><zone xml:id="m-8647f380-b89e-43ed-b115-3372adf3e081" ulx="61" uly="870" lrx="925" lry="909" /><zone xml:id="m-ee6d7fca-38fb-4190-8bd3-cd0197361e83" ulx="136" uly="921" lrx="830" lry="965" /><zone xml:id="m-d7c362a3-ca69-45c6-b218-3775e7763110" ulx="425" uly="967" lrx="541" lry="1011" /><zone xml:id="m-9fedc82d-8d86-48c7-b26e-949d9609fbb3" ulx="79" uly="999" lrx="929" lry="1042" /><zone xml:id="m-910fb5ad-0383-43ec-96bc-984ecc6a9729" ulx="484" uly="1031" lrx="929" lry="1065" /><zone xml:id="m-0781366c-bce7-4fbc-94bc-449433c43f0f" ulx="39" uly="1032" lrx="476" lry="1067" /><zone xml:id="m-9307eabf-afc2-49be-8d97-cf92a5ed6140" ulx="35" uly="1060" lrx="478" lry="1097" /><zone xml:id="m-8d1249fd-4e24-4cce-ab11-7a69a23c114e" ulx="485" uly="1060" lrx="929" lry="1092" /><zone xml:id="m-a31f3253-e3fc-4427-b6c0-efb5dff71dae" ulx="35" uly="1086" lrx="790" lry="1124" /><zone xml:id="m-a1893dd3-2bac-4738-91f4-793c66fd88ff" ulx="428" uly="1122" lrx="528" lry="1163" /><zone xml:id="m-9aa1ed78-cbcd-42a5-b8e3-4dbd5d246e22" ulx="46" uly="1152" lrx="929" lry="1193" /><zone xml:id="m-926e8f65-a548-4b30-b839-abb9d3fe6c49" ulx="37" uly="1184" lrx="929" lry="1224" /><zone xml:id="m-1bb1e596-3f79-4c6f-ab8d-c378682efc92" ulx="35" uly="1213" lrx="589" lry="1252" /><zone xml:id="m-097c8bb5-2405-439d-957c-59f79902a1ae" ulx="357" uly="1253" lrx="602" lry="1289" /><zone xml:id="m-21011d0f-930e-4b33-a77b-966f70d0905c" ulx="76" uly="1281" lrx="926" lry="1320" /><zone xml:id="m-3f9ba6d4-7af1-4495-9538-974fdaedc839" ulx="36" uly="1312" lrx="877" lry="1348" /><zone xml:id="m-cc33eb41-8b87-41c3-9918-31f540851d5c" ulx="32" uly="1340" lrx="486" lry="1381" /><zone xml:id="m-662edac3-178d-4f84-8696-4d8f78c19677" ulx="233" uly="1390" lrx="719" lry="1430" /><zone xml:id="m-ca8d0519-acb6-4a25-9a90-b9cae13aec0a" ulx="423" uly="1431" lrx="541" lry="1468" /><zone xml:id="m-6c823537-a9ce-44ee-9981-0985039ce384" ulx="76" uly="1465" lrx="927" lry="1500" /><zone xml:id="m-692dc2f4-3e03-40ee-9d0f-d05ce8fd7e4d" ulx="37" uly="1491" lrx="478" lry="1530" /><zone xml:id="m-85a3f329-0285-426f-9e10-6ac33d051674" ulx="480" uly="1493" lrx="926" lry="1530" /><zone xml:id="m-d4074bae-710a-4b3e-b677-72a01a7fa0f0" ulx="483" uly="1520" lrx="585" lry="1558" /><zone xml:id="m-c6ea8c62-d469-4150-a4c4-adbe1e185ad8" ulx="32" uly="1521" lrx="475" lry="1555" /><zone xml:id="m-e77e4860-1e9d-45f8-94e7-1328141fe919" ulx="31" uly="1546" lrx="474" lry="1586" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-6c77d7aa-85eb-4020-a058-85d2c5d2dbc6" n="1499" facs="#m-32c770bc-abb1-4e19-b167-4b45c7a4504d" /><div xml:id="m-34d4a65c-bc98-4038-818a-a56c913a0b48">
            <lg xml:id="m-77846cee-f6be-4b9d-a14e-a7862e91414f">
              <l xml:id="m-6ef2a59a-e3a3-4ae2-9911-f8a9a1de2412" facs="#m-b6dc4bb8-2ff6-4c47-864f-7533fc718044" label="ambiguous">OCCASIONAL PRAYERS.</l><l xml:id="m-ba80c140-9ea6-4ec5-b76b-0ac672bc5a98" facs="#m-983c00d5-a5d4-4c17-ab23-ee06c6aa9509" label="text-like">The foltowing Prayers are those from which the priest selects the prayers</l><l xml:id="m-7b78075f-adf6-41d0-8621-8d6bcd1ecee5" facs="#m-2f5f7441-2ff3-4e73-b632-614706a3842c" label="text-like">teft to his choice on certain days wnich are not of double rite. The Prayer</l><l xml:id="m-d1f951f7-5306-4971-b2da-9a2005aa53b4" facs="#m-82ed9e51-6994-447e-be72-c16b4ad28098" label="text-like">chosen is added after the Prayers of the day.</l><l xml:id="m-9f2cd0fc-4242-4b30-b415-a20e12a25bc7" facs="#m-c67516e0-0aa4-4f53-a655-dfe8ab628119" label="text-like">To implore the intercession of the Saints. Collect. A cunctis.</l><l xml:id="m-eced371c-ecd7-43a5-93ef-d9776fc1bfe7" facs="#m-ffb896e7-a125-4af4-975d-ba1a0e76e45b" label="ambiguous">D.498. Secret, p. 501. Postcommunton, p. 502.</l><l xml:id="m-01b04d28-e615-493c-9bec-ed9263c86ce7" facs="#m-eb71ed04-f9d4-435f-aba4-c04822ee0089" label="text-like">For the whole Hierarchy of the Church.</l><l xml:id="m-8971b93d-22e9-417f-bdb8-c0f22db976d5" facs="#m-f3be90ba-fca9-4db6-a41e-631558babd26" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-97429ae1-6586-4119-9ecd-2dfd0272755d" facs="#m-6e93ec57-74eb-4b9f-b20f-503414d0cd89" label="lyrics-like">Mnípotens sempitérne Deus, cu-l cántes; ut grátiae tuae múnere, ab</l><l xml:id="m-3f05bf3f-6c43-4638-9551-7f0d92dd1b77" facs="#m-bd9938a3-f37b-4f24-bb92-4e13af848deb" label="lyrics-like">U jus spiritu totum corpus Ecclé- ómnibus tibi grádibus fidéliter ser¬</l><l xml:id="m-c1aac2b5-0552-43db-98b8-e0dbf62acda2" facs="#m-62d27ffe-e2ee-4a09-aabe-15c06e211cea" label="lyrics-like">siae sanctificátur et régitur : exáudi ] viátur. Per Dóminum... in unitáte</l><l xml:id="m-01fe42d0-8a95-4f2a-a910-a006ef0bb14b" facs="#m-0163324f-24f1-4c5a-b426-185bbe8760bd" label="lyrics-like">nos pro univérsis Ordínibus suppli- ejúsdem.</l><l xml:id="m-45632ec7-664e-4830-9f05-64e33c4cf3a0" facs="#m-e7a7c88a-eece-43f4-85c3-c20e4c05b0c5" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-155b7127-05d7-4873-af20-fedc9878e648" facs="#m-d767f971-a1ea-4fdd-baa0-ca2e5c9737a3" label="lyrics-like">A fámulis tuis, Dómine, indul-l pétuam : ut tibi serviéntes, ad tuam</l><l xml:id="m-4407bb86-80c0-4558-9461-56428d531d62" facs="#m-46321627-6d10-4139-92db-93dfa490caa2" label="lyrics-like">I géntiam peccatórum, consola¬ júgiter misericórdiam pervenire me¬</l><l xml:id="m-6d8ff5bd-d6bc-463f-a6a5-246762a98e81" facs="#m-464fbfc0-d18a-4d18-97b8-8bae1e254bcf" label="lyrics-like">tiónem vitae, gubernatiónem per-reántur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-da4cc47f-ca82-4120-bc35-367e9f2e35c8" facs="#m-395c6c0c-f6a5-410b-b603-5d8dde9b64c4" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-11b4d8ea-0504-402a-92b8-a099e67261ca" facs="#m-41c95de3-7912-4294-afec-e494781229a1" label="lyrics-like">Ibera, quaésumus Dómine, a l conversatióne vivéntes, nullis affi¬</l><l xml:id="m-0760c030-e1bf-41ab-bbef-f3476e2ebd77" facs="#m-227721d5-653d-4ea9-8ce0-4b90e75bffc1" label="lyrics-like">I peccátis et hóstibus fámúlos! ciántur advérsis. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-26f76f6c-69c7-4632-a7ce-b0b69e22ae1f" facs="#m-e1a168bc-d76e-46c6-a753-e7fc8b8d09a6" label="lyrics-like">tuos, tibi supplicántes: ut in sancta</l><l xml:id="m-bda8ed46-ab73-4f29-bd0b-e611edb9c10c" facs="#m-8647f380-b89e-43ed-b115-3372adf3e081" label="text-like">For the Pope. Collect, p. 319. Secret, p. 322. Postcommunion, p. 323.</l><l xml:id="m-27a6970f-c255-4c56-9e2b-cb7b8c9ea879" facs="#m-ee6d7fca-38fb-4190-8bd3-cd0197361e83" label="text-like">For Prelates and for those under their charge.</l><l xml:id="m-18eb2415-0ddf-4ac5-a57f-8b4b1c56c6a7" facs="#m-d7c362a3-ca69-45c6-b218-3775e7763110" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-4b622d02-0fef-48d4-86f7-d6944a0c20ac" facs="#m-9fedc82d-8d86-48c7-b26e-949d9609fbb3" label="lyrics-like">Mnípotens sempitérne Deus, qui [ sas, spiritum grátiae salutáris; et</l><l xml:id="m-ea42888f-8b4a-415c-88a4-faafbba10c23" facs="#m-910fb5ad-0383-43ec-96bc-984ecc6a9729" label="lyrics-like">ut in veritáte tibi compláceant, per¬</l><l xml:id="m-de7c2f31-b8f8-4fb0-88e6-a0e216c89355" facs="#m-0781366c-bce7-4fbc-94bc-449433c43f0f" label="ambiguous">U facis mirabilia magna solus:</l><l xml:id="m-10a62e5e-2acf-4c25-bc18-365739a88b40" facs="#m-9307eabf-afc2-49be-8d97-cf92a5ed6140" label="lyrics-like">praeténde super fámulos tuos, et</l><l xml:id="m-905f6a54-c046-4c71-9406-ab9ee95a6c9e" facs="#m-8d1249fd-4e24-4cce-ab11-7a69a23c114e" label="lyrics-like">pétuum eis rorem tuae benedictiónis</l><l xml:id="m-4e17239c-07b7-44fd-bbab-48f9bd9473ee" facs="#m-a31f3253-e3fc-4427-b6c0-efb5dff71dae" label="lyrics-like">super congregatiónes illis commis-infúnde. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-8cb8c6c8-2b4e-47fc-83c2-3044ffe9b64b" facs="#m-a1893dd3-2bac-4738-91f4-793c66fd88ff" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-66298b0c-6685-496a-a745-726c383bfa14" facs="#m-9aa1ed78-cbcd-42a5-b8e3-4dbd5d246e22" label="lyrics-like">L Ostias, Dómine, famulórum tuó-] mente pro eis celebrámus, proficere</l><l xml:id="m-b0c2a9a7-ac64-440e-ad7a-12c944d47601" facs="#m-926e8f65-a548-4b30-b839-abb9d3fe6c49" label="lyrics-like">It rum placátus inténde; et quas sibi séntiant ad medélam. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-9c234f85-3da4-47c4-9c33-f5e4bd024761" facs="#m-1bb1e596-3f79-4c6f-ab8d-c378682efc92" label="lyrics-like">in honórem nóminis tui devótal minum.</l><l xml:id="m-8f82e2ab-36c8-4523-bb9e-bd9ac072635a" facs="#m-097c8bb5-2405-439d-957c-59f79902a1ae" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-848869ff-8984-4f91-a424-f235987ad20c" facs="#m-21011d0f-930e-4b33-a77b-966f70d0905c" label="lyrics-like">Uos caelésti récreas múnere, nis, dignos fieri sempitérna redem¬</l><l xml:id="m-ceb3f2fa-2112-4bd2-a16e-268528ad13b6" facs="#m-3f9ba6d4-7af1-4495-9538-974fdaedc839" label="lyrics-like">U perpétuo, Dómine, comitáre ptiône concéde. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-8c084c3c-1968-466f-8b7b-abfb742a1dd1" facs="#m-cc33eb41-8b87-41c3-9918-31f540851d5c" label="lyrics-like">praesídio: et quos fovére non dési¬</l><l xml:id="m-2152f3b3-8648-490b-ac08-00821797d60d" facs="#m-662edac3-178d-4f84-8696-4d8f78c19677" label="text-like">For a Congregation or a Family.</l><l xml:id="m-23038a85-9f34-403e-9e2d-d2c4a780eee2" facs="#m-ca8d0519-acb6-4a25-9a90-b9cae13aec0a" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-12ec80be-0eb9-444f-ab2a-8c994e8d0ce3" facs="#m-6c823537-a9ce-44ee-9981-0985039ce384" label="lyrics-like">Efénde, quaésumus Dómine, prostrátam, ab hóstium propitius</l><l xml:id="m-62c31bd3-6e62-4a41-955a-727bcf375016" facs="#m-692dc2f4-3e03-40ee-9d0f-d05ce8fd7e4d" label="lyrics-like">U beáta Maria semper Virgine</l><l xml:id="m-d699bb3c-7aae-40ba-b3df-fbd43713f92c" facs="#m-85a3f329-0285-426f-9e10-6ac33d051674" label="lyrics-like">tuére cleménter insidiis. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-1a166301-6a8b-4720-b9a4-5850c09918f3" facs="#m-d4074bae-710a-4b3e-b677-72a01a7fa0f0" label="ambiguous">minum.</l><l xml:id="m-62080418-d0f0-4ba6-b691-dfd1f1a82edd" facs="#m-c6ea8c62-d469-4150-a4c4-adbe1e185ad8" label="lyrics-like">intercedénte, istam ab omni adver¬</l><l xml:id="m-1afa6425-0d6b-4764-b16a-c39c6e3bd9c9" facs="#m-e77e4860-1e9d-45f8-94e7-1328141fe919" label="lyrics-like">sitáte familiam : et toto corde tibi</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>